4. Conveying Verbatim Copies.

You may convey verbatim copies of the Program in any medium as you
choose, with its object code and source code, provided that you
convey it with this License.

5. Conveying Modified Source Versions.

You may convey a modified version of the Program under the terms of
this License.

6. Conveying Non-Source Forms.

You may convey a non-source form of the Program if you also convey
the Corresponding Source under this License.

7. Additional Terms.

"Additional permissions" are terms that are added to the terms of this
License.

8. Termination.

You may not exercise the rights granted under this License if your
license has been terminated.

9. Acceptance Not Required for Having Copies.

You are not required to accept this License in order to receive or
make a copy of the Program.

10. Automatic Licensing of Downstream Conveyers.

Each time you convey a covered work, the recipient automatically
